{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And as for Yishmael, I have heard you.</b> That I bless him, but I will not cut My covenant with him. But My covenant I will establish with Yitzhak, for I cut a covenant between the pieces to give his seed the land of Canaan. In the pericope of circumcision, <i>berit</i> (covenant) is mentioned thirteen times — covenants, to teach you that they correspond to a thirteen-year-old, who when he has not yet circumcised himself and does not circumcise himself incurs <i>karet</i>."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:04:30.338755449Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}